{"title":"查询清单审核记录","icon":"","img":"","tags":"","hideInMenu":"false","text":"module","cls":"Wb.Module","properties":{"cid":"module","serverScript":"Wb.sendRowx({\n  sql: `select a.*,b.display_name \nfrom thjs.tb_projlist_inout_comment a \nleft join basic_thjs.wb_user b\non a.create_user = b.user_name\nwhere a.proj_id = {?i_projid?}\nand (a.batch_id = {?i_batchid?} or {?i_batchid?} is null)\nand a.inout_type = {?i_inout_type?}\nand a.inout_direct = {?i_inout_direct?}\norder by a.create_time desc`});"},"_icon":"module"}